            "review_title": "Review at Nanachan Crepes",
            "review_text": "Linh C\n1 contribution\n0\nHaruzuku Crepes in Saigon\nMar 2017 • Friends\n- Product: The 1st time coming here, I chose their best seller combo 6 (Nanachan's crepe) with gelato, chantilly cream and chocolate sauce. Specially you can freely choose your favorite gelato favour then I chose Matcha. My crepe is soft and tender yet is crispy around the egdes. Chantilly cream is sweet enough and matcha gelato is good. Off course chocolate sauce is so good too because of making from Marou chocolate.\n- Price: 58,000vnd (approximately 3$)\n- Staff: nice \n- Store design: lovely with pastel colors (blue, pink) and white \n- Come back or not?: Come back for sure\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 13, 2017",
